{"t":"Primal Pod","s":"primal-pod-cf7d9","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Primal_Pod_3607a7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Primal Pod</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Primal Pod\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Primal_Pod_3607a7.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffff99; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">2 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.90.12182<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 18, 2022<br/>Summer Update 2022</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230726190715&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Primal_Pod_3607a7.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a primal pod.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>All the hunting grounds of <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomprona\">Gnomprona</a> and in <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Primal%20Menace\">The Primal Menace</a> fight room.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Primal Pods can appear when a Gnomprona creatures dies, including any of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Primal%20Pack%20Beast\">Primal Pack Beasts</a>. On hazard level 1, characters have a 0.875% chance to spawn them. \n</p><p>They must be stepped on quickly, otherwise a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fungosaurus\">Fungosaurus</a> will spawn for each Pod that is not stomped. They have two stages, each lasting 2 seconds. The first stage can be safely stepped on without damage, but the second stage will deal 5% of the character's current HP plus 500 as <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Damage</a> when stomped. \n</p><p>A Primal Pod will start blinking in yellow color when its time is almost up: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Primal Pod 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Primal_Pod_2_2672c0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fungosaurus\">Fungosaurus</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/primal-ordeal-quest\">Primal Ordeal Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Primal%20Menace\">The Primal Menace</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["primal-ordeal-quest"]}